ance',\\n\\n  Line 223: \\tappearance_system: 'Auto',\\n\\n  Line 224: \\tappearance_light: 'Light',\\n...\n\n/workspace/docs/jobs/still_theme-appearance-mode/tasks.md:\n  Line 21: TASK-3: Render the small Auto/Light/Dark segmented control in `AppSettings.svelte`, visible only when `themeState.theme.supportsDarkMode`, bound to the new `appearance` state via `setAppearance()`.\n\n  Line 40:   - New key constant `static readonly LS_APPEARANCE_KEY: string = 'appearance'` (existing keys are the bare `'theme'` / `'animations'` strings, so no `_` prefix needed).\n\n  Line 41:   - New `$state<'system' | 'light' | 'dark'>` field defaulting to `'system'`; restore it in `load()` (graceful fallback for unknown/absent values), persist via `this.localStorage.set(...)` in a new `setAppearance()` method that re-resolves dark immediately.\n\n\n/workspace/src/lib/components/settings/AppSettings.svelte:\n  Line 69: \t\t\t\t\t\tonclick={() => themeState.setAppearance(option.value)}\n","metadata":{"matches":39,"truncated":false},"title":"setAppearance|LS_APPEARANCE","time":{"start":1791709459830,"end":1791709459873}},"id":"prt_12a34b4dc001ZSvnLtR6UeGDNI","sessionID":"ses_ed5cc28c2fferyTpyy2Zhxl0sU","messageID":"msg_12a3494b5001CWMqi6zJDM5n5M"}}
